# One WireGuard tunnel per unordered pair (dedupe: this.index < remote.index)
hamburg <-> barcelona: "UDP 51820" {style.stroke-dash: 3}

note: |md
  Each edge is a WireGuard tunnel on its own UDP port (both ends forward it).
  Plug into a node's exit port / join its exit SSID to browse from that country.
| {near: bottom-center}
